# Schema Metadata for mise.schema and mise.json

## Source Information
- **Config Format**: TOML (mise configuration files are TOML)
- **Schema Format**: JSON Schema (the schema describing the TOML config is in JSON)
- **Schema URL**: https://mise.jdx.dev/schema/mise.json
- **Alternative URL**: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jdx/mise/main/schema/mise.json
- **Downloaded Date**: 2025-10-28
- **Official Documentation**: https://mise.jdx.dev/
- **License**: MIT (per Mise project)

## Files
- **mise.schema**: Custom TOML-based schema definition (legacy, for internal use)
- **mise.json**: Official JSON schema from Mise project (for reference and future integration)

## Modifications
- **Date**: 2025-10-28
- **Modified by**: N/A
- **Reason**: Official JSON schema is used as-is for reference
- **Changes**: None - official schema is used directly

## Update History
- 2025-10-28: Downloaded official JSON schema for reference (mise configs remain TOML)
- Original: Custom TOML-based schema created from documentation

## Notes
- **Important**: Mise configuration files use TOML format, not JSON
- The JSON schema is metadata that describes the structure of TOML configs
- Custom mise.schema is still used by the parser (mise.go)
- Official mise.json is kept for reference and potential future migration
- To update: Download latest from https://mise.jdx.dev/schema/mise.json
- See AGENTS.md for schema source policy
